stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft
    draft --> gtg : human approves + deps closed
    gtg --> prompt_pending : pipeline triggered
    prompt_pending --> prompt_review : PromptWriter complete
    prompt_review --> planning : human approves prompt
    prompt_review --> prompt_pending : human rejects (PromptWriter reruns)
    planning --> executing : Planner complete
    executing --> testing : Executor commits
    testing --> review_nonblocking : tests pass
    testing --> review_blocking : tests fail
    review_nonblocking --> closed : auto-merge
    review_blocking --> executing : human re-triggers
    closed --> [*]

    note right of gtg
        All dependencies closed
        + human_approved = true
    end note

    note right of prompt_review
        ONLY MANDATORY
        HUMAN GATE
    end note

    note right of review_nonblocking
        Branch merges to main
        Next story starts immediately
    end note

    note right of review_blocking
        Branch held
        Human must resolve
    end note
